# sccs v2.65.1 | Claude Code Sync Tool (UV)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
▸ Setup:    uv venv --python 3.12 && venv+ && uv pip install -e ".[dev]"
▸ Sync:     sccs sync --dry-run
▸ Sync+Git: sccs sync --commit --push
▸ Status:   sccs status
▸ Test:     pytest --cov=sccs
▸ Lint:     ruff check sccs/ tests/ && ruff format --check sccs/ tests/
▸ Doctor:   sccs doctor check
▸ Zsh:      sccs convert fish-to-zsh --dry-run
▸ Codex:    sccs integrations codex export-all --dry-run
▸ Hooks:    sccs integrations codex export-hooks --dry-run  (danach /hooks in Codex)
▸ Profile:  sccs profile off gsd
▸ Statusln: sccs statusline list
▸ Deploy:   sccs deploy export odoo-server -o odoo.zip --dry-run
▸ Build:    uv build
